    {
      "id": "sol.ahsme-1955-p47.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "The difference is \\[ \\begin{aligned} &(a+b)(a+c)-(a+bc)\\\\ &\\qquad=a^2+ab+ac-a\\\\ &\\qquad=a(a+b+c-1). \\end{aligned} \\] In particular, whenever \\(a+b+c=1,\\) this difference is zero and the expressions are equal.\n\nThus, the correct answer is C.",
